		{
			"id":"d5ef99f6f1c39c22",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Guide\n\n1. Draft a [[027 - Library.canvas|027 - Library]] room and order a book.\n2. When you draft a Library room again, the book will have a date signed with the date that you ordered the book.\n3. From this you can assume that the starting date or day 0 is November 6th.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-520,
			"y":-340,
			"width":500,
			"height":260
		},
		{
			"id":"b66b1beb70ce06d5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"There are other ways of finding the starting date, such as the [[030 - Drafting Studio.canvas|030 - Drafting Studio]] and probably many other ways.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-520,
			"y":-40,
			"width":520,
			"height":100
		}
